# `go build ./...` drops one binary per main package into the working
# directory. They are build output, not source, and a 32 MB blob committed by
# accident is not something a review of a diff summary catches.
/alarmd
/alarmd-node-runner
# The embedded alarmd-cli release is build output; only its placeholder is
# source.
/clirelease/assets/*
!/clirelease/assets/README.md
